---
layout: base.njk
title: "Teachings"
description: "Three ways to study Scripture with David: weekly teachings, The Whole Story (a 26-lesson walk through the entire Bible), and Deeper Studies for readers who want to dig in."
permalink: /teachings/
tags: []
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<style>
.track-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2.4rem; }
.track { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--foam); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink); transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease; }
.track:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 22px 40px -24px rgba(14, 59, 69, 0.35); }
.track .art { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; background: var(--mist); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--foam); overflow: hidden; }
.track .art img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
.track .body { padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem 1.6rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.55rem; flex: 1; }
.track h3 { font-size: 1.9rem; color: var(--deep); }
.track p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.6; flex: 1; }
.track .meta { font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--ink-faint); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 0.7rem; }
.track .meta b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
.track .go { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ocean); }
.track.study { border-color: var(--gold-soft); }
.track.study .eyebrow, .track.study .go { color: var(--gold-deep); }
@media (max-width: 980px) { .track-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .track-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.track.deep { border-color: var(--deep); }
.track.deep .eyebrow, .track.deep .go { color: var(--deep); }
</style>

{%- set latest = collections.teachings | weeklyOnly | reverse | first %}
{%- set deeper = collections.teachings | deeperOnly | reverse %}
{%- set lessonCount = collections.bibleStudy | lessonsOnly | length %}
<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="center">
      <div class="eyebrow">Teachings</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Three ways to study.</h2>
      <p class="lead narrow">Pick the one that fits where you are. The weekly teachings take one truth and open it up from Scripture in a single sitting. The Whole Story walks the entire Bible from beginning to end, one lesson at a time. Deeper Studies are for when you are ready to dig in.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="track-grid">
      <a class="track" href="/teachings/weekly/">
        <div class="art"><img src="{{ (latest.data.ogImage or '/assets/whole-story-01-scroll.jpg') | card }}" alt="" loading="eager" width="800" height="589"></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="eyebrow">Weekly Teachings</div>
          <h3>One truth, opened up</h3>
          <p>Short, serious studies from Scripture: the context, the original Greek and Hebrew, and what the text asks of us. A new one every week or so, each with a printable study guide.</p>
          {%- if latest %}<div class="meta">Latest: <b>{{ latest.data.title }}</b> &middot; {{ latest.data.passage }}</div>{% endif %}
          <span class="go">Read the weekly teachings &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="track study" href="/bible-study/">
        <div class="art"><img src="{{ '/assets/whole-story-01-river.jpg' | card }}" alt="" loading="eager" width="800" height="589"></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="eyebrow">Bible Study &middot; 26 Lessons</div>
          <h3>The Whole Story</h3>
          <p>A walk through the whole Bible, Genesis to Revelation, for anyone who did not grow up in church. Real dates, a timeline, and the two threads that carry the gospel from the garden to the cross to the city of God.</p>
          <div class="meta"><b>{{ lessonCount }} of 26</b> lessons published &middot; start with Lesson 1</div>
          <span class="go">Start the Bible study &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="track deep" href="/teachings/deeper/">
        <div class="art"><img src="{{ '/assets/teaching-rhw-ezra.jpg' | card }}" alt="" loading="eager" width="800" height="589"></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="eyebrow">Deeper Studies</div>
          <h3>For when you are ready to dig in</h3>
          <p>Longer, careful studies with more Scripture, more of the original languages, and more of what faithful teachers have said. Each one has a shorter version for anyone just starting out.</p>
          {%- if deeper | length %}<div class="meta"><b>{{ deeper | length }}</b> {% if deeper | length == 1 %}study{% else %}studies{% endif %} &middot; latest: <b>{{ (deeper | first).data.title }}</b></div>{% endif %}
          <span class="go">Explore the deeper studies &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "signup.njk" %}
